1
00:00:00,399 --> 00:00:02,069
(Raj:)Hey, Penny, can you
give me a hand with this?

2
00:00:02,069 --> 00:00:03,239
(Sheldon:)Sure.

3
00:00:03,237 --> 00:00:04,837
Aw, we had one of
these growing up.

4
00:00:04,838 --> 00:00:06,308
(Penny:)I used to play
all the time.

5
00:00:06,306 --> 00:00:08,076
(Raj:)Oh, yeah?
I love Ping-Pong.

6
00:00:08,075 --> 00:00:10,175
(Penny:)Oh, I meant beer pong.

7
00:00:11,477 --> 00:00:12,977
(Amy:)I had a table, too,

8
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:15,550
(Amy:)but I didn't have any friends,
so all I did was serve.

9
00:00:16,949 --> 00:00:19,349
(Bernadette:)You know, you can leave one
side up and play against it.

10
00:00:19,353 --> 00:00:22,123
(Amy:)And if I had a friend,
they might have told me that.

11
00:00:24,824 --> 00:00:26,494
(Howard:)Excuse me.

12
00:00:26,493 --> 00:00:28,663
(Howard:)Why is there a sticker on this?

13
00:00:28,662 --> 00:00:30,532
(Howard:)It's my TARDIS
from Doctor Who.

14
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:32,600
(Howard:)I was planning on
moving it in the house.

15
00:00:32,599 --> 00:00:34,669
(Bernadette:)I think you just answered
your own question.

16
00:00:36,102 --> 00:00:38,772
(Howard:)Come on, one day,
this may double in value

17
00:00:38,772 --> 00:00:41,442
(Howard:)and be worth half
what I paid for it.

18
00:00:41,441 --> 00:00:43,111
(Bernadette:)Sweetie, we have a lot to do.

19
00:00:43,110 --> 00:00:44,840
(Bernadette:)We don't need
to decide this right now.

20
00:00:44,845 --> 00:00:47,845
(Howard:)Well, I guess as long as
you're keeping an open mind.

21
00:00:47,848 --> 00:00:49,578
(Bernadette:)Of course.

22
00:00:54,720 --> 00:01:05,020
♪ ♪

